OL,3,GNEWSAFinal checks carried out on new
OL,4,A#30m road under M4
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new #30m road which runs under the M4
OL,7,Fcould open as soon as next month.
OL,9,FThe Southern Access Road, which
OL,10,Fconnects Junction 16 of the M4 with the
OL,11,FWichelstowe estate in Wiltshire, was
OL,12,Fcompleted in 2023 but has remained
OL,13,Fclosed due to delays in connecting it
OL,14,Fto the existing road network.
OL,16,FA spokesperson from Swindon Borough
OL,17,FCouncil said the "final road checks"
OL,18,Fwere being carried out and it was hoped
OL,19,Fthe "road will be opened by the end of
OL,20,Fnext month".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
