OL,3,GNEWSAFinal checks carried out on new
OL,4,A#30m road under M4
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Webb, who drove to Wichelstowe's
OL,7,FWaitrose from Swindon, said while he
OL,8,Fdoes not "think the traffic is that
OL,9,Fbad", anything "that balances out cars"
OL,10,Fwould "be a good thing".
